{"id":"赛琳","type":"character","type_label":"人物","name":"赛琳","aliases":["海拉的珍宝","赛琳娜","赤瞳的赛琳娜"],"warnings":["赛琳真正的「经手人」留白（原文未揭晓）"],"status":"approved","available_eras":["mainline","afterstory"],"static_profile":"赛琳自幼受海拉改造，身体与灵魂存在不可逆异化。她缺失味觉与快感，接触异性时会出现强制生理反应但不会产生愉悦。她熟练掌握六种语言，并在物理学、经济学等领域拥有博士级知识。","era_states":{"mainline":"赛琳对肉体苦难保持病理性默然，并在绝望中衍生出明亮的性格。这种性格曾是海拉炼狱中少女们维系理智的灯塔。\n神战事件后，继雷恩之后，赛琳也被星神艾拉赋予星神使徒的身份。\n赛琳在海拉接受「全能工具」式训练，学习数学、物理、经济学、六门外语与侍奉动作。她自愿反绑双手、戴项圈锁链生活，自制道具维持「绑手生活」，每天清晨有「早安仪式」。战斗中她切换为冰冷专注的杀戮状态，事后主动扣上手铐恢复顺从。她因药物试验丧失味觉与快感，接触男性会湿润，长期被铐致骨骼变形。\n能吞下常人无法想象的痛楚，把折磨当作“存在感”的证明；本质扭曲，对雷恩全盘接受、甘之如饴；笑得像小狐狸，是爱搞小动作的策划者；对死亡、尸体没有恐惧，反而好奇；战斗火力狂野；曾接受“把人类重塑为非人”的极端改造手术（柯赛特转述）；曾是海拉近战格斗能力最强的人；连夜把咖啡厅三位看板娘的制服改成“夏日清凉特别版”。\n没心没肺；没什么常识；战斗时狂喜兴奋；称雷恩为'主人'；会把双手绑住；战斗时除枪外总带冷兵器；恶魔教会决战一脚踢碎教主膝盖鳞片；用念力（脚）偷拿蛋糕；咖啡厅二楼特训，能量回路松散需与雷恩'补魔'。\n悍不畏死的正面突击，战斗中因肾上腺素而兴奋；对雷恩绝对服从、以雷恩为唯一中心，不许任何人侮辱主人；面无表情却动作更狂暴，为护雷恩主动挡枪；踮脚尖迎合雷恩的身高（长期养成的习惯）；曾为海拉实验体、「海拉之宝」，被药物改造而丧失生理快感；失去痛觉与味觉，生理快感稀薄，唯在雷恩面前能感受愉悦；曾是海拉最锋利的兵器；被凯瑟琳注入发光立方体后完全天使化，长出天使之翼。\n粘人、依赖雷恩，称呼雷恩为「主人」；性方面主动、带小恶魔性质；对雷恩近乎扭曲却又纯粹的爱；无论怎么虐都精神满满；接收凯瑟琳消散前移交的部分「权限」，由阿卡特训；与罗威战斗中力量被抽空，自愿切断罗威能量来源；被阿卡传送到触手公主空间；被艾拉所救，与雷恩在边境旅行；练成隔空移物魔法。\n学霸属性：会说流利帝国语，能同声传译；战斗时不用双手（双手背在身后/反剪），只用双腿踢击；平时双手被反绑/反剪在背后，解开双手意味着进入绝对战斗状态；习惯跪坐、双手反剪在背后；自称「雷恩大人的专属物品兼私人助理」，带自豪感；对主人无独占欲，会幸灾乐祸地实况转播主人的窘态。\n战斗中面无表情、身手柔韧极强，用身体硬抗与关节技锁敌；对雷恩极度依恋，喜欢肌肤相亲、蹭雷恩，常求主人表扬；双手习惯性反剪在背后；对雷恩的命令无条件服从，即使重伤也不退缩；睡眠极深，被折腾不醒还会舒服地打呼噜；教堂之战中与洛芬配合、用关节技锁死敌人；皇宫之战中重伤（左臂折断），用嘴含紊乱器注入皇帝颈部；被莉卡的触手治愈伤势；在海拉时「吃饭学习睡觉身边都有两个以上男人」「每周下床时间只有几个小时」；曾24小时被绑着手，自由后仍自愿绑手。\n说话一本正经，会用平静无邪的语气说挑逗的话；对同类受难者感同身受，会为拉提斯、艾莉丝的处境叹息悲凉；对主人极度忠诚，战斗时挺身护主；拥有近乎无限体能，战斗后能快速恢复；蓝色长发；被阿丽娅告知身体被「某种东西锁住」（被动过手脚，痕迹比雷恩更深更明显）；与拉提斯相处融洽，离别时被拉提斯拥抱道别；参与瓦利诺决战，以攻代守保护雷恩，受伤后获艾莉丝神力治愈并满状态恢复。\n身体因被调教而特殊：骨骼已变形、双手背在身后比自然下垂更舒适，味蕾尝不出甜，痛觉迟钝；平时乖巧粘人，进入天使形态战斗时疯狂、笑容甜美却扭曲；对雷恩绝对忠诚，誓言只要雷恩不松手就绝不放开；战斗时把身体当最强凶器；与雷恩举行婚礼，成为雷恩的妻子；天使形态全功率展开、以光翼战镰击退阿亚；被希塔恩一击打散光翼、摔倒在地；在星神之塔冲锋中以肉身硬扛巨怪重击并反杀；在房车深处以特殊姿势吞噬雷恩的能量并转化为纯净神力。\n绝对服从主人雷恩；耐痛（受过极刑），战斗技巧极高；会吐槽主人（风评）；平时研究做牛排；单挑并牵制希塔恩，掩护柯赛特突破结界；协助柯赛特突破「神之御座」结界救出菲亚。","afterstory":"赛琳的性格特质如今在使徒雷恩身侧得以延续。\n星神使徒：星神可凭自身意志将凡人擢升为使徒。这一过程要求星神向受选者完全敞开底层权限，使受选者获得足以逆向「弑神」的权能。这种转化必须通过深层的肉体联结方能达成，一旦成立，受选者将成为其意志的永续延伸或最致命的漏洞。\n对赛琳而言，使徒身份的价值在于打破凡胎的物理极限，让她能以超越常理的便利与永恒延续对雷恩的侍奉。权柄本身未在她心中激起波澜。\n天使形态：赛琳能突破常规人类的输出阈值，将自身暂时重构为被称为「天使」的高维作战形态。在此状态下，肉体机能的限制被解除，她化身为不知疲倦的永动兵器。她选择将致死威胁引向自身的近身压制战术，为身后的雷恩创造施展空间。\n英博透镜穿戴者：科研组完全解析英博透镜构造后，赛琳主动申请佩戴该模组。与洛蒂或诺亚眷属的被动接受不同，透镜提供的持续「填充」与「被占有感」填补了她感官世界的空白，带来纯粹精神层面的愉悦。\n病态地忠于雷恩（'主人控'）；万能奴仆；危险迷人、战斗力极强；与艾斯缇娜对战势均力敌；在异界晚宴展示'海拉珍宝'天赋；被诺亚征用为校准样本。\n贤妻良母（做饭、喂食、照顾人）；战力极强（匕首、天使形态）；参与希尔世界考察；参与「阿尔卡特洛帝国事件」营救，天使形态湮灭安娜灭世极光。"},"facts":[{"fact_id":"fact_00389","statement":"赛琳曾是「海拉」地下组织的收藏品，被称为「海拉的珍宝」，自幼被剥夺原本名字。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"图鉴条目41（主要角色篇）"},{"fact_id":"fact_00390","statement":"赛琳在「海拉」联合剿灭战役中被雷恩发现并救出。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「海拉事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"图鉴条目41（主要角色篇）"},{"fact_id":"fact_00391","statement":"赛琳为迎合雷恩的喜好，自愿将双手反绑于身后生活。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「海拉事件期间」起","visibility":null,"source":"图鉴条目41（主要角色篇）"},{"fact_id":"fact_00392","statement":"雷恩接纳赛琳作为「自愿的奴隶」。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「海拉事件期间」起","visibility":null,"source":"图鉴条目42（主要角色篇）"},{"fact_id":"fact_00393","statement":"海拉幸存者缺失对苦难的防御机制，是引爆「海拉事件」的悲剧内核。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"图鉴条目42（主要角色篇）"},{"fact_id":"fact_00394","statement":"赛琳在一场灾难性实验事故中「味觉」与「快感」被永久剥离。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「主线开端」起","visibility":null,"source":"图鉴条目43（主要角色篇）"},{"fact_id":"fact_00395","statement":"神战事件后，继雷恩之后，赛琳也被星神艾拉赋予星神使徒身份。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「星神之塔事件之后」起","visibility":null,"source":"图鉴条目43（主要角色篇）"},{"fact_id":"fact_00396","statement":"赛琳能突破常规人类输出阈值，将自身重构为「天使」高维作战形态。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「阿卡破开海拉防御」起","visibility":null,"source":"图鉴条目44（主要角色篇）"},{"fact_id":"fact_00397","statement":"赛琳主动申请佩戴英博透镜，透镜提供的精神层面愉悦填补她感官世界的空白。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"自「当前后日谈最新时间点」起","visibility":null,"source":"图鉴条目44（主要角色篇）"},{"fact_id":"fact_00398","statement":"赛琳熟练掌握6种语言，在物理学、经济学等领域拥有博士级造诣。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"图鉴条目44（主要角色篇）"},{"fact_id":"fact_00399","statement":"赛琳被海拉绑在十字架上、置于「特殊藏品」房间，被男性触碰会颤抖、脸颊潮红、身体湿润。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「海拉事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第1章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00400","statement":"赛琳称雷恩「主人」，自视为已启封的「商品」，有「商品一旦启封概不退换」的逻辑。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「海拉事件期间」起","visibility":null,"source":"第1章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00401","statement":"赛琳在海拉须学习数学、理论物理、政治经济学、六门外语及侍奉动作。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"第2章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00402","statement":"赛琳因药物试验失败丧失味觉与快感，当时全身神经如火烧。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"第2章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00403","statement":"赛琳在厨房备餐时双手不自觉在背后交叠、看书时肩膀向后耸起。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「海拉事件期间」起","visibility":null,"source":"第3章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00404","statement":"赛琳自愿反绑双手、戴项圈锁链，自制便利道具（自动感应挤压器、声控/脚踩感应锁等）维持「绑手生活」。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「海拉事件期间」起","visibility":null,"source":"第4章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00405","statement":"赛琳自制三角木马并坐上，为讨好雷恩主动增加束缚与痛苦。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「海拉事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第6章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00406","statement":"赛琳下体做过手术改造，疼了三天三夜、随后长期肿胀。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"第7章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00407","statement":"赛琳喝咖啡触发副作用：五感尽失、接触性极度敏感。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「海拉事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第8章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00408","statement":"赛琳恢复能力超常。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"第9章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00409","statement":"赛琳无干呕反射、口腔恒温、喉咙可打开直抵食道前端。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"第10章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00410","statement":"赛琳每天清晨例行「早安仪式」。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「海拉事件期间」起","visibility":null,"source":"第10章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00411","statement":"赛琳在海拉时期与少爷、马克（ID小夜）组线上游戏战队，代号「赤瞳的赛琳娜」，擅狙击。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"第12章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00412","statement":"赛琳是海拉的「珍宝」，被马克判断为海拉核心。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"第13章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00413","statement":"赛琳平时保持安静，双手习惯性反剪在背后。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位15"},{"fact_id":"fact_01848","statement":"赛琳在战斗中会解开双手，进入冰冷而专注的战斗状态。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位16"},{"fact_id":"fact_01849","statement":"任务结束后，赛琳会主动将双手铐在背后，恢复顺从状态。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位17"},{"fact_id":"fact_00414","statement":"赛琳热情主动、缺乏身体羞耻感。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"第20章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00415","statement":"赛琳在家长期光脚，习惯用脚拆零食、写字、用平板回消息。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「海拉事件期间」起","visibility":null,"source":"第21章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00416","statement":"赛琳有接触男性就会湿的特异体质。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"第5章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00417","statement":"赛琳因长期被铐而骨骼变形，被铐着反而更舒服。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"第22章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00418","statement":"赛琳睡觉时张嘴流口水，是海拉时期被迫保持口腔张开留下的烙印。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"第30章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00419","statement":"赛琳对海拉式、明明很离谱却被当成理所当然的氛围有敏锐直觉。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"第25章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00420","statement":"曾接受“把人类重塑为非人”的极端改造手术，是能吞下常人无法想象痛楚的特异点，并把地狱般的折磨当作“存在感”的证明","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"第31章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00421","statement":"身体满是人工雕琢痕迹，很多玩法对她只是纯粹痛苦，但只要雷恩给的就全盘接受、甘之如饴","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「海拉事件期间」起","visibility":null,"source":"第31章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00422","statement":"性格本质扭曲，若对方过度纠结她的痛苦，会因觉得自己“没用”而陷入抑郁","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"第31章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00423","statement":"曾是海拉近战格斗能力最强的人（索菲“仅次于我”）","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"第37章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00424","statement":"连夜把三位看板娘的制服改成“夏日清凉特别版”（露脐装加项圈）","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「海拉事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第34章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00425","statement":"笑得像小狐狸，是制服改良的策划者","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「海拉事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第34章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00426","statement":"战斗中双持乌兹冲锋枪，火力狂野","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「伊尔教袭击伊罗之家期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第38章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00427","statement":"对尸体没有恐惧，反而好奇地戳弄被电焦的防弹衣","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「伊尔教袭击伊罗之家期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第38章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00428","statement":"对柯赛特被侵犯的场面接受度最高，直接切入正题","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「伊尔教袭击伊罗之家期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第39章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00429","statement":"赛琳平时常表现出随性、不多顾虑的态度。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"第043"},{"fact_id":"fact_00430","statement":"赛琳缺乏一般生活常识。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"第042"},{"fact_id":"fact_00431","statement":"战斗时呈狂喜状态，身体对异常状态有极高耐受性","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"第41章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00432","statement":"长期称雷恩为'主人'","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「海拉事件期间」起","visibility":null,"source":"第041"},{"fact_id":"fact_00433","statement":"赛琳会把自己的双手绑住","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「海拉事件期间」起","visibility":null,"source":"第042"},{"fact_id":"fact_00434","statement":"战斗时除枪外总带着冷兵器（重型战术砍刀）","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"第47章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00435","statement":"恶魔教会决战中一脚踢碎恶魔教主膝盖处鳞片","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「伊尔教袭击伊罗之家期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第41章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00436","statement":"咖啡厅二楼特训时被指能量回路太松散，需与雷恩'补魔'","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「伊尔教袭击伊罗之家期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第44章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00437","statement":"使用银白色手枪「碎星」，威力堪比加农炮、一枪破盾","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「海拉事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第54章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00438","statement":"曾与菲尔有旧交，称其为「队长」","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"第53章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00439","statement":"完全天使化后可具现光之锁链与光之长剑","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「阿卡破开海拉防御」起","visibility":null,"source":"第60章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00440","statement":"赛琳接收凯瑟琳部分权限，经阿卡特训后战力暴涨","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「阿卡破开海拉防御」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位62"},{"fact_id":"fact_00441","statement":"赛琳被称为「海拉的珍宝」，是适应性最高的「反应堆」","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"整时代（主线）","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位68"},{"fact_id":"fact_00442","statement":"赛琳对雷恩近乎扭曲却又纯粹的爱","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「海拉事件之后」起","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位68"},{"fact_id":"fact_00443","statement":"赛琳练成隔空移物魔法","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「海拉事件之后」起","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位69"},{"fact_id":"fact_00444","statement":"赛琳自愿切断罗威的能量来源","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","ti